jobs.description:
Do you have a passion for music, digital marketing and the power of data-driven campaigns? Are you excited about finding creative ways to amplify music and reach new audiences? Do you combine an analytical mindset with creativity, and a hands-on approach? Then you might be the Digital Campaign Manager we’re looking for.

**What will you be doing?**

* Implementing Paid Media campaigns across all platforms;
* Optimising and reporting on campaigns both internally and externally;
* Finding opportunities to use paid media to amplify Armada records;
* Optimising the workflow of internal reporting and general admin;
* Creating content to use across media platforms for advertising;
* Using AI tools to create new workflows within Armada and performance marketing;
* Presenting findings and recommendations to team members.

**Who are we looking for?**

* You have 1-2 years of experience in performance marketing, paid media or a similar digital marketing role;
* You have an understanding of digital advertising platforms and are eager to develop your skills in setting up and managing campaigns;
* You are passionate about dance music;
* You are comfortable working with numbers and data, and interested in learning how to translate campaign performance into actionable insights;
* You are organised, detail-oriented and proactive, with an eagerness to take ownership of tasks and learn along the way;
* You have a creative mindset and are curious about AI tools and new technologies;
* You are fluent in English.

**What will we offer you in return?**

At Armada Music, you’ll be pursuing your passion on an international scale. Calling an inspiring and musical environment home, you’ll work alongside a young and dynamic team of skilled coworkers, both during office hours and at Thursday afternoon drinks. We’ll pay you a monthly salary befitting your experience and offer favourable secondary working conditions. And one more thing, please keep in mind that this position is at our Amsterdam/London office. Therefore, we prefer applicants who live within those cities or a reasonable travel distance to our offices.

**ABOUT ARMADA MUSIC:**

Armada Music is the biggest independent dance music label in the world, founded in 2003 by Armin van Buuren, Maykel Piron and David Lewis (AR-MA-DA). Promoting dance music all over the world from its offices in Amsterdam (HQ) and London, Armada Music represents and cultivates the creative exploits of some of the biggest players in the electronic music game, including Armin van Buuren, ARTY, D.O.D, Eelke Kleijn, Jan Blomqvist, Hannah Laing, Layton Giordani, Dj Fresh, Andy C, Arodes, Deep Dish, Bloom Twins and Franc Fala.
